   "id": "tricky-doors-203573@post-2026-07-17",
   "gameId": "tricky-doors-203573",
   "displayName": "In the new episode, you'll enter a world where childhood fears come to life.",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2026-07-17T09:13:15.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Your son has vanished, and to find him, you must venture beyond the familiar world. Empty streets, twisted buildings, and monsters born from a child's imagination await at every turn. But your greatest weapon is that same imagination. Solve puzzles, unlock tricky doors, and carve your way to your son.",
