  {
   "id": "tricky-doors-203573@post-2026-05-14",
   "gameId": "tricky-doors-203573",
   "displayName": "The line between reality and fantasy blurs in our latest episodes!",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2026-05-14T13:49:53.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Your journey begins in a cozy hut hidden deep within the tropics, where the song of exotic birds masks the mystery of your imprisonment. From the sweltering heat of the jungle, you’ll be thrust into the ocean’s icy embrace: aboard a deserted tanker, only the crashing waves know where the crew has vanished.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Should you escape the frozen clutches of the sea, your path leads across endless steppes to a mystical castle, whose walls and ghostly sentinels guard the only way out of the wasteland. And when your strength finally fades, a fairytale dream offers a final refuge. But beware — what was meant to be a respite turns into a magical snare that refuses to let you go.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Whether you find yourself lost in the jungle, trapped in the frost, or wandering through a dream — your goal remains the same. Find your way to freedom!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
