   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Five more game locations have been prepared for you! Sail on the luxurious ship, master the control of the aircraft, wander around the shopping mall, and explore the temples of ancient Maya and Egyptians. Solve lots of new puzzles and find peculiar solutions to get out of situations that look like there is no escape!",
